{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2c4ae409e7a96fad4945cded88bf91b3926e380d222d2443e4ae13c856d91364", "ja": "（茨城での仕事が終わり、空いた時間で紗代子と\n観光をした。地元なだけに、紗代子も張り切っていた）", "zh": "（茨城的工作结束后，利用空闲时间和纱代子一起游览了一番。毕竟是当地，纱代子也格外起劲。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "5a738e9d08827f45793952275beebee815d6155f50f0a8402187e3ca1545b0ad", "ja": "{$P$}、今日は付き合ってくれて\nありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}，今天谢谢你陪我一起逛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1002_p", "source_sha256": "66746628ddbeb9d3daf2a28faedbdb92c7cc7685bd077cddbb8de4961b809cc3", "ja": "お礼を言うのはこっちの方だよ。\n「茨城を案内する」って言いだした時は驚いたけど。", "zh": "该说谢谢的是我才对。\n你说要“带我逛逛茨城”的时候，可真让我吃了一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "08d73f2f9a2ecf4fefc78973585d9c385221c090f9881d4eaf461dfc018a0340", "ja": "せっかくの機会ですし、{$P$}にも\n地元のこと色々と知ってほしいと思って。", "zh": "难得有这样的机会，我也想让{$P$}了解一些家乡的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "b8166118f4b82921ca969d053fa6dd21b9ec31c9cbf4e9d3dd22f1d35583de00", "ja": "今日行った公園ですけど……\n子供の時、家族で行った場所なんです。", "zh": "至于今天去的那个公园……那是我小时候和家人一起去过的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4894cd9d0cb6b2f5f01ae980dc738d13c3d916b25229286fdf848043f11e745d", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n紗代子の思い出の場所だったんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n那是纱代子的回忆之地啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "d958cd5f6e5cf15788076cbc7bc33b64227aa39adbcfa3ddfc6d2174855c928a", "ja": "はい！　最近は、あまり行く機会がなくて。\n久しぶりに、一面のネモフィラが見たいなって……。", "zh": "是的！最近没什么机会去。\n我想久违地再看看漫山遍野的粉蝶花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "dc90511de602a6fa5d458ec45d168eb3ee44746acf5ab41e786c70ddb5ff79d5", "ja": "あの素敵な景色を、{$P$}に\n見てほしいなって思ったんです。", "zh": "我想着，要是能让{$P$}看看那片美丽的景色就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4fdc28f8616efa670d170764a3407b42d57a7ceb960d4e272f54fce34d0ee6a3", "ja": "それで誘ってくれたんだな。紗代子のおかげで\nすごくいい時間が過ごせたよ。ありがとな。", "zh": "所以你才邀请我的啊。多亏了纱代子，我度过了一段非常愉快的时光。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "f65f02828c73d6af03b119f6a051e3c85b067f3d71f59404c0de98ede23e192f", "ja": "いえ、私こそ！　一緒に同じ景色をみられましたし、\n急な雨でバタバタしたりしましたけど……。", "zh": "不，我才要谢谢您！不仅能一起欣赏相同的景色，\n虽然中途还因为突如其来的雨而手忙脚乱就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "af4a7f82209e7a9909afbe46d3b6455a7b54ab20c5583b01985bbc3f328dee52", "ja": "普段はできない経験がたくさんできて……。\nふふっ。誘って、よかったなって思いました！", "zh": "平时做不到的事情，这次都体验到了……。\n呵呵。我觉得，邀请你来真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1011_p", "source_sha256": "aecea12c28d26828cc57ad33b6bcd0af6467165b9d2f54b9ffc715f6f95b886b", "ja": "ははっ。\n紗代子が楽しんでくれたなら、よかった。", "zh": "哈哈。\n只要纱代子玩得开心，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "b5c536958a94ca4bd6802e2d4fafe2b326c41f2a42ee763de1c59c19d3ddc517", "ja": "あ、でも……\n一つだけちょっと後悔してることがあって……。", "zh": "啊，不过……\n有一件事，我稍微有点后悔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d32aa00b96fabe9ff80a5afebaadeb502f40f6be95e5507d72d46ae7ac481a23", "ja": "えっ？　なんだ？", "zh": "诶？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "169b94bcd64a4dc12fe5fbf585fbcd3aaaa7056ca6caae50253700c2b9761f49", "ja": "本当は……{$P$}を連れていきたい\n場所が、もっともっとあるんです！", "zh": "其实……还有很多很多地方，想带{$P$}先生一起去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "1f40a67cea2f786b60d2b22c6edaecbab9834597cf7e01ea2fcc2be8db757c8d", "ja": "ちゃんと予定も立ててたんですけど、\n公園で過ごした時間が楽しくて……。", "zh": "我本来还好好安排了计划，不过在公园度过的时光太开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9b348c26594f30ad37f2f63b0f37d7832349c6a8adf2ac4cd11f7dd6e793b795", "ja": "はは、そういうことか。\nじゃあ、今度の機会にまた誘ってくれるか？", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。\n那下次有机会的话，还会邀请我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "708b802e7cdbdac47eecf80e717efd09861a5ebfbb849dfef337acc9b86dc3bf", "ja": "……いいんですか？", "zh": "……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8eb50270ca5352f31035d7e792a4a9b31c5ae6bd5522a4bae9c6eabd8d6183c2", "ja": "もちろんだよ。\n紗代子さえよければ、また茨城を案内して欲しいな。", "zh": "当然可以。\n只要纱代子乐意，我还想让你带我逛逛茨城呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "bee6689468416825d056f6010649acc9f563070fbf1381f7c4595ac155a80214", "ja": "は、はい！　絶対に誘います！\n茨城の魅力をぎっしり詰め込んだ予定を計画しますね！", "zh": "好、好的！我一定会邀请您的！\n我会制定一份满满都是茨城魅力的行程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0454_1020_p", "source_sha256": "22643b476a842dbc92f77792901cb14762525aab67c70f0ea2ed4b4dc687bcb9", "ja": "（今日一番、紗代子の目が輝いていたかもしれない。\n紗代子の茨城の観光ツアー……次が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（今天紗代子的眼睛可能是最闪亮的。紗代子的茨城观光之旅……真期待下次啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
